Description: AI-Native Offensive Security Terminal & Kali Linux Orchestrator
 NeuroShell Cyber transforms traditional penetration testing workflows with
 on-device AI intelligence (EmbeddingGemma 2 270M INT8 ONNX), an engagement
 scope guard (CIDR whitelist protection), persistent SQLite WAL target graph,
 autonomous payload crafter, staging delivery server, TTY shell auto-stabilization,
 and real-time ANSI vulnerability cards for Nmap, Gobuster, FFuF, Nuclei, and SQLmap.
